1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,809
This walkthrough shows the monthly
inspection of feed pump B in the

2
00:00:04,859 --> 00:00:06,130
maintenance console.

3
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:09,390
It's a fictional procedure, made for this
portfolio.

4
00:00:09,990 --> 00:00:11,570
Open the work order.

5
00:00:11,570 --> 00:00:16,080
It lists the four checks and the expected
range for each.

6
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:17,900
Select Record readings.

7
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:22,238
Enter each reading as you took it from the
local gauge:

8
00:00:22,288 --> 00:00:27,060
the discharge pressure in bar, the bearing
temperature, the vibration,

9
00:00:27,110 --> 00:00:28,970
and whether the seal leaks.

10
00:00:28,970 --> 00:00:30,740
Then select Save readings.

11
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:34,300
Every result now shows against its range.

12
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:38,620
All four are inside it, so the work order
is ready to close.

13
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:40,880
Select Close work order.

14
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:43,774
If any reading had been outside its range,

15
00:00:43,824 --> 00:00:47,470
you would report it to the shift
supervisor instead.

16
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:49,450
That's the procedure.

17
00:00:49,450 --> 00:00:54,690
The written version, the step guide and
the DITA output are in the same package.
